  "sourceTitle": "Gooseberry Relish",
  "sourceText": "Gooseberry Relish\nBy: Kevin Tu\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n5 cups Gooseberries\n1 cup Brown sugar\n1 1/2 cups Raisins\n1 Onion, peeled and sliced\n3 tablespoons Salt\n1/4 teaspoon Cayenne pepper\n1 teaspoon Mustard\n1 teaspoon Ginger\n1 teaspoon Turmeric\n1 quart Vinegar\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Chop gooseberries, raisins, and onion. Add other ingredients. Heat slowly to boiling. Simmer 3/4 hour. Stir frequently. Rub through coarse sieve. 2 Reheat. Harriet Hinzinga, Pella, IA.",
